# Crossroads of Time (WotG 15) with the decouple module loaded and no nation quest done. The zone-in from East
# Ronfaure [S] plays 145 and its finish completes the mission.
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/onZoneIn/1 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/145
module modules/custom/lua/wotg_decouple_story_missions_from_nation_quests.lua
char zone=EastRonfaureS pos=322,-60,503 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg CrossroadsOfTime current
login
warp 100.801,1,103.211 SouthernSanDoriaS open   # from East Ronfaure [S]: 145
finish
